<title>USA: Freddie Mac sets $225 in passthrough C033.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac sets $225 in passthrough C033.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac or FHLMC) said Tuesday it issued $225 million in callable passthrough issue C033.</p>
<p>Issue C033, underwritten by PaineWebber Group Inc, is backed by $225 million of 30-year single-family fixed-rate mortgages, the agency said.</p>
<p>The issue has a coupon of 8.0 percent, a pricing date of January 23 and a settlement date of February 28, FHLMC said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
</text>
